WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.184 --> 00:00:11.616
The fine line that makes or breaks hanbok hairstyling is skillful volume control.

2
00:00:11.952 --> 00:00:20.232
Piling it up too high while chasing elegance can actually make you look ten years older.

3
00:00:20.568 --> 00:00:26.112
On the other hand, too little volume looks shabby next to the fullness of the hanbok.

4
00:00:26.448 --> 00:00:38.952
True elegance comes from placing volume exactly where it suits your face shape and letting the hair's natural flow show through instead of stiff spray, adding a modern touch.

5
00:00:39.288 --> 00:00:47.280
This isn't just a matter of technique — it comes from a stylist's refined eye for reading the wedding parent's overall look.

6
00:00:47.616 --> 00:00:54.120
The knack for using just the right amount of volume to keep a wedding parent looking youthful — that's the whole point.
